---
layout: base.njk
title: "Become a founding firm | DossierIQ by PASI"
description: "A small group of elder law and estate firms use DossierIQ at no cost during the pilot, with hands-on setup, and help shape what we build next. Apply in about two minutes."
---
<article class="page wrap">
  <h1>Become a DossierIQ founding firm.</h1>
  <p class="page-lead">We're working closely with a small group of elder law and estate firms to make DossierIQ fit real practice. Founding firms use DossierIQ at no cost during the pilot, get hands-on setup and training, and help shape what we build next. We're starting in Pennsylvania and glad to hear from firms anywhere in the US.</p>

  <div class="two-lists">
    <section aria-labelledby="gets-h">
      <h2 id="gets-h">What your firm gets</h2>
      <ul class="ruled">
        <li>DossierIQ at no cost during the pilot</li>
        <li>Hands-on setup and training for your team</li>
        <li>A direct line to the founder; your feedback shapes what we build next</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="asks-h">
      <h2 id="asks-h">What we ask</h2>
      <ul class="ruled">
        <li>Use DossierIQ on real matters for the pilot period</li>
        <li>Short feedback conversations along the way</li>
        <li>If it helps you, a reference or a brief case study (only with your permission)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
    <h2 id="faq-h">Questions</h2>
    <details>
      <summary>What does the pilot cost?</summary>
      <p>Nothing during the pilot. We'll agree the length of the pilot with you up front, and we won't charge you without talking to you first.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Which email and storage systems does it work with?</summary>
      <p>Google Workspace and Microsoft 365. Documents stay in your firm's own Google Drive or SharePoint, and your team signs in with a Google or Microsoft work account.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Do we have to be in Pennsylvania?</summary>
      <p>No. We're starting in Pennsylvania, and we're glad to hear from firms anywhere in the US.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Is DossierIQ legal advice?</summary>
      <p>No. DossierIQ organizes and flags; attorneys and staff confirm. PASI is a software company, not a law firm.</p>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section class="apply" id="apply" aria-labelledby="apply-h">
    <h2 id="apply-h">Apply</h2>
    <p class="fine">This takes about two minutes. We'll only use your answers to reply to you and to understand who we're helping. We also keep your IP address and browser type to block spam. Fields marked "required" are needed; the rest are optional.</p>
    <form class="form" action="{{ site.applyUrl }}" method="post">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="f-name">Your name <span class="req">required</span></label>
        <input id="f-name" name="name" type="text" required minlength="2" maxlength="200" autocomplete="name">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="f-email">Work email <span class="req">required</span></label>
        <input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" aria-describedby="f-email-help">
        <p class="help" id="f-email-help">Please use your firm's address, not a personal one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="f-firm">Firm name <span class="req">required</span></label>
        <input id="f-firm" name="firm" type="text" required minlength="2" maxlength="200" autocomplete="organization">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="f-state">State where the firm practices <span class="req">required</span></label>
        <select id="f-state" name="state" required>
          <option value="">Choose a state</option>
          {% for s in founding.states %}<option>{{ s }}</option>{% endfor %}
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="f-role">Your role</label>
        <select id="f-role" name="role">
          <option value="">Choose one</option>
          {% for r in founding.roles %}<option>{{ r }}</option>{% endfor %}
        </select>
      </div>
      <fieldset class="field">
        <legend>Practice areas</legend>
        {% for a in founding.practiceAreas %}<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="practiceAreas" value="{{ a }}"> {{ a }}</label>{% endfor %}
      </fieldset>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="f-size">Firm size</label>
        <select id="f-size" name="firmSize">
          <option value="">Choose one</option>
          {% for s in founding.firmSizes %}<option>{{ s }}</option>{% endfor %}
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="f-mail">Email and file storage system</label>
        <select id="f-mail" name="mailSystem" aria-describedby="f-mail-help">
          <option value="">Choose one</option>
          {% for m in founding.mailSystems %}<option>{{ m }}</option>{% endfor %}
        </select>
        <p class="help" id="f-mail-help">DossierIQ works with Google Drive and SharePoint.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="f-note">What slows your intake down?</label>
        <textarea id="f-note" name="intakeNote" rows="3" maxlength="300" aria-describedby="f-note-help"></textarea>
        <p class="help" id="f-note-help">A sentence or two is plenty (300 characters). Please don't include client names or details.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="f-heard">How did you hear about us?</label>
        <select id="f-heard" name="heardFrom">
          <option value="">Choose one</option>
          {% for h in founding.heardFrom %}<option>{{ h }}</option>{% endfor %}
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
        <label for="f-website">Leave this empty</label>
        <input id="f-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label class="check consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required> <span>{{ founding.consentText }} See the <a href="{{ site.privacyUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy notice<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab, so your answers stay here)</span></a>. <span class="req">required</span></span></label>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" type="submit">Apply as a founding firm</button>
      <p class="fine fallback">If the form doesn't send, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Founding%20firm%20application">{{ site.email }}</a> with your name, firm and state, and we'll reply the same way.</p>
    </form>
  </section>
</article>
